  "content_rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0;min-height:430px;aspect-ratio:unset;\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-100 has-background-dim has-background-gradient has-very-light-gray-to-cyan-bluish-gray-gradient-background\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-cover-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-top\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-lg--margin-top\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-vk-heading-both_ends has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-4f64facfbe3755281b7379617f0909c0\">料金プラン (ガイド１名＋車両１台）</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>＊ご利用人数は車両によって異なります。セダンタイプに一度に乗車できるのは最高４名（大人）。バンタイプは最大７名</strong>まで。</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-3 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-bottom:0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-white-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-d5f0bd9215fb205479854cca367fd4ba is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"color:#000000;padding-top:2em;padding-right:2em;padding-bottom:2em;padding-left:2em\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"single\" style=\"font-size:2rem\">Shortプラン</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-normal-font-size\" style=\"line-height:1.5\">お目当てのツアーのために<br></p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-css-opacity has-background is-style-wide\" style=\"background-color:#000000;color:#000000\"/>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list has-normal-font-size\">\n<li>チャモロビレッジ</li>\n\n\n\n<li>朝市フリーマーケット</li>\n\n\n\n<li>北部観光</li>\n\n\n\n<li>所要時間　３時間</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-top\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-md--margin-top\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-button vk_button vk_button-color-custom vk_button-align-center\"><a href=\"/short-plan\" class=\"vk_button_link btn has-background has-vk-color-primary-background-color btn-md\" role=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" rel=\"noopener\"><div class=\"vk_button_link_caption\"><span class=\"vk_button_link_txt\">Short プランの詳細を見る</span></div></a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-luminous-vivid-amber-to-luminous-vivid-orange-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-745200d6546d4dec1f9910d899cfa4d2 is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"color:#000000;padding-top:2em;padding-right:2em;padding-bottom:2em;padding-left:2em\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"family\" style=\"font-size:2rem\">Middleプラン</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-normal-font-size\" style=\"line-height:1.5\"><strong>一番人気！</strong><br></p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-css-opacity is-style-wide\"/>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list has-normal-font-size\">\n<li>ショッピング＆ディナー</li>\n\n\n\n<li>観光＆ショッピング</li>\n\n\n\n<li>自由にプランをカスタマイズ</li>\n\n\n\n<li>所要時間　５時間</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-top\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-md--margin-top\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-button vk_button vk_button-color-custom vk_button-align-center\"><a href=\"/middleplan\" class=\"vk_button_link btn has-background has-vk-color-primary-background-color btn-md\" role=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" rel=\"noopener\"><div class=\"vk_button_link_caption\"><span class=\"vk_button_link_txt\">Middle プランの詳細を見る</span></div></a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-white-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-37926ce47d1170b69046aa8cb7cb0258 is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"color:#000000;padding-top:2em;padding-right:2em;padding-bottom:2em;padding-left:2em\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"patron\" style=\"font-size:2rem\">Longプラン</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-normal-font-size\"><strong>観光も食事もショッピングも！</strong>　<br></p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-css-opacity is-style-wide\"/>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list has-normal-font-size\">\n<li>アクティビティ＆観光</li>\n\n\n\n<li>１日ショッピングツアー</li>\n\n\n\n<li>南部一周ツアーに最適</li>\n\n\n\n<li>自由にプランをカスタマイズ</li>\n\n\n\n<li>所要時間　８時間</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-button vk_button vk_button-color-custom vk_button-align-center\"><a href=\"/long-tour\" class=\"vk_button_link btn has-background has-vk-color-primary-background-color btn-md\" role=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" rel=\"noopener\"><div class=\"vk_button_link_caption\"><span class=\"vk_button_link_txt\">Long プランの詳細を見る</span></div></a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-white-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-22c52c17716ed2c779c6ce2787d08321 is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"color:#000000;padding-top:2em;padding-right:2em;padding-bottom:2em;padding-left:2em\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"patron\" style=\"font-size:2rem\">Totalプラン</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-normal-font-size\">１２時間専属コーディネーター<br><strong>１日貸し切りプラン</strong>　（２日間から）</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-css-opacity is-style-wide\"/>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list has-normal-font-size\">\n<li>アクティビティ＆観光＆ショッピング</li>\n\n\n\n<li>１日トータルサポート</li>\n\n\n\n<li>滞在中のLINEサポート</li>\n\n\n\n<li>自由にプランをカスタマイズ</li>\n\n\n\n<li>所要時間　１２時間</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-button vk_button vk_button-color-custom vk_button-align-center\"><a href=\"/totalplan\" class=\"vk_button_link btn has-background has-vk-color-primary-background-color btn-md\" role=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" rel=\"noopener\"><div class=\"vk_button_link_caption\"><span class=\"vk_button_link_txt\">Total プランの詳細を見る</span></div></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-top\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-lg--margin-top\"></div></div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-top\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-md--margin-top\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-vk-heading-both_ends has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-a4720e854d88470055702c89a00eb015\">各プラン比較</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-top\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-md--margin-top\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table is-style-stripes\"><table class=\"has-luminous-vivid-amber-to-luminous-vivid-orange-gradient-background has-background has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>ツアー</th><th class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><span data-fontsize=\"18px\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\" class=\"vk_inline-font-size\">Short (３時間)</span></strong></th><th><strong><span data-fontsize=\"18px\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\" class=\"vk_inline-font-size\">Middle (5時間)</span></strong></th><th class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><span data-fontsize=\"18px\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\" class=\"vk_inline-font-size\">Long （７－８時間）</span></th><th class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><span data-fontsize=\"18px\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\" class=\"vk_inline-font-size\">Total（１日貸し切り ２日間より）</span></strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong><span data-fontsize=\"18px\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\" class=\"vk_inline-font-size\">ツアー料金</span></strong></td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><span data-fontsize=\"21px\" style=\"font-size: 21px;\" class=\"vk_inline-font-size\">$170</span></strong></td><td><strong><span data-fontsize=\"21px\" style=\"font-size: 21px;\" class=\"vk_inline-font-size\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vk-color-primary-vivid-color\">               </mark>$250</span></strong></td><td class=\"has-