line-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\"><a href=\"/linesupport\">LINE サポート</a></mark></td><td>＄２５　（滞在中最長７日間）　＊出張の場合は別途料金がかかります＊</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>＊オプションはどのプランでもご利用ただけます。</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-top\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-md--margin-top\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"veu_socialSet veu_socialSet-position-after veu_contentAddSection\"><script>window.twttr=(function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],t=window.twttr||{};if(d.getElementById(id))return t;js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\"https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js\";fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);t._e=[];t.ready=function(f){t._e.push(f);};return t;}(document,\"script\",\"twitter-wjs\"));</script><ul><li class=\"sb_facebook sb_icon\"><a class=\"sb_icon_inner\" href=\"//www.facebook.com/sharer.php?src=bm&u=https%3A%2F%2Fmokaruguam.com%2Fservice%2Fprice%2F&amp;t=Mokaru%20Guam\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"window.open(this.href,'FBwindow','width=650,height=450,menubar=no,toolbar=no,scrollbars=yes');return false;\"><span class=\"vk_icon_w_r_sns_fb icon_sns\"></span><span class=\"sns_txt\">Facebook</span><span class=\"veu_count_sns_fb\"></span></a></li></ul></div><!-- [ /.socialSet ] -->"
